{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/extras/GifPage.gif?t=1751565077\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nocturnal 2</strong> is a Metroidvania game where your goal is to awaken a city trapped in slumber by lighting its mechanisms and spreading fire throughout its quarters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your map to explore every corner, find what needs to be rekindled, and burn anything that stands in your way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carry your flames across the island, avoiding anything that could extinguish them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your blade to rekindle ancient mechanisms and torches, gradually awakening Ytash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect fragments of a lost poem, uncovering the story of a city that consumed itself long ago.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a compact island offering a streamlined adventure focused on a singular concept, with many secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2847780?t=1751565077","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2847780?t=1751565077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/dda1d77c56611ed38d63c4d250e29619515995b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751565077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2847780/dda1d77c56611ed38d63c4d250e29619515995b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751565077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"